.env.local
.env*.local

.verify-credentials

# QGIS delivery simulation: the SCRIPTS and README are committed, the DATA is not.
#
# 9.5MB of national shapefiles/rasters plus a 2.2MB GeoPackage of simulated
# output, all of it either downloadable again or reproducible by re-running
# run_musuwo_simulation.py. This repository has already been through one
# large-file problem (see Images/ above); adding 12MB of derived geodata that
# nothing in the build reads would be repeating it on purpose.
qgis_musuwo/data/
qgis_musuwo/MUSUWO_MUTARE_SIMULATION_OUTPUT/
qgis_musuwo/__pycache__/
qgis_musuwo/qgis_run.log
ZWE_*.zip
symbology-style.db
__pycache__/
